stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> connecting
    connecting --> idle: connected frame
    idle --> searching: queue_status SEARCHING
    searching --> idle: queue_status IDLE
    searching --> chatting: matched
    chatting --> ended: partner_skipped · partner_disconnected · you left
    ended --> searching: auto-search, or Start
    ended --> idle: the user stops
    connecting --> disconnected: socket closed
    chatting --> disconnected: socket closed
    disconnected --> connecting: reconnect attempt
